{"title":"2021 CIME I","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>2021 CIME I</b> was held on January 2, 2021. The first link contains the full set of test problems. The rest contain each individual problem and it’s solution.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems\">2021 CIME I Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CIME I Answer Key (page does not exist)\">2021 CIME I Answer Key</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 1\">2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 2\">2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 3\">2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 7\">2021 CIME I Problems/Problem 7</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CIME_I_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CIME I Problems/Problem